      "exceptions": ["Work within an accepted boundary cites existing Prime basis rather than recreating it."],
      "grounding": [
        {
          "end_line": 1006,
          "quote": "A function-and-carrier-only pass does not establish whole-family Prime.",
          "section_id": "repo://stdo-v3-generation/codex/5a5b5ad80f0ba4b56b83aadd42ac130de53ba803/source/standards/DESIGN_MODULE_METHOD.md#Design%20Module%20Method%2F4B.%20Ontology-First%20Design%20Rule%2FWhole-Family%20Prime%20Contraction",
          "start_line": 984
        },
        {
          "end_line": 1025,
          "quote": "Contraction must preserve root authority and every retained semantic relation.",
          "section_id": "repo://stdo-v3-generation/codex/5a5b5ad80f0ba4b56b83aadd42ac130de53ba803/source/standards/DESIGN_MODULE_METHOD.md#Design%20Module%20Method%2F4B.%20Ontology-First%20Design%20Rule%2FRecursive%20Prime%20And%20Root%20Conservation%20%28%60STDO-UP-003%60%29",
          "start_line": 1010
        }
      ],
      "key": "whole_family_prime_contraction",
      "statement": "Review each atom and then complete candidate family plus every realization projection, including identities, authority transitions, lifecycle, topology, functions, composition, effects and closure. Ask whether operations are parameters, commands lifecycle transitions, reads projections, implementations higher-order applications; whether independent identity/authority/effect/lifecycle/reuse/public-pattern-match meaning is introduced; whether every atom kind entered contraction; whether every unit explicitly maps to accepted atoms; and whether projections introduce/duplicate/reinterpret meaning/authority. Individually plausible functions are not Prime if one parameterized template/closed variants preserves meaning/authority. Visible recurrence contracts during design; later recurrence review is no substitute. Local irreducibility/conformance cannot prove global Prime while family duplicates identity/authority/function/lifecycle/topology/effect/projection. Preserve root authority and every retained semantic relation; fewer files/functions/operations/surfaces cannot excuse new authority/truth paths. Evidence states complete family, each atom's stable identity/irreducible relation/domain/falsifier, whole-family contraction, before/after meaning/authority, accepted loss and total realization-to-accepted-atoms mapping.",
